At NC Digital, we combine professional web design with search engine optimisation so your website doesn't just look good — it gets found. Every site we build is optimised for Google from the ground up.

## What is SEO web design?

Most websites are built with design in mind and SEO as an afterthought. The problem is that a beautiful website nobody can find is a wasted investment. SEO web design flips that approach — building the technical foundations, content structure, and keyword strategy into the site from day one, not bolted on after launch.

This means faster results, a stronger website, and no expensive retrofitting further down the line.

## What's included in our SEO web design service

- Custom WordPress website built with SEO best practices
- Keyword research to inform page structure and content
- On-page SEO — meta titles, descriptions, headings, image alt text
- Fast-loading, mobile-first design
- Local SEO setup for South Wales searches
- Google Search Console submission and indexing
- Internal linking strategy across all pages
- Full CMS access so you can update content yourself

## Why SEO needs to be built in, not bolted on

When SEO is added to a website after launch, you're often working against the grain — retrofitting structure, rewriting content, and fixing technical issues that should never have existed. When it's part of the build from the start, every decision — from page URLs to heading hierarchy to content length — is made with search visibility in mind.

The result is a website that starts gaining traction faster and requires less remedial work.

## Who this is for

Our SEO web design service is ideal for South Wales small businesses that want a new website and want it to perform well on Google from the moment it goes live. Whether you're a tradesperson in Merthyr Tydfil, a professional service in Cardiff, or a retailer in Swansea, we build sites that attract local customers searching for exactly what you offer.

## Why choose NC Digital?

We're a South Wales agency that keeps things simple. No jargon, no unnecessary upsells — just honest advice and websites that do what they're supposed to do. We understand local search and we understand small business.

Ready to get started? [Get in touch](/contact/) for a free, no-obligation conversation about your website.

## Frequently asked questions

**Does every website you build include SEO?**
Yes — basic on-page SEO is included in every project. For ongoing SEO work to grow your rankings over time, we also offer [local SEO services](/services/local-seo-google-ranking/).

**What platform do you build on?**
We build on WordPress, which gives you full ownership of your site, excellent SEO capabilities, and the flexibility to grow over time.

**How long does it take?**
Most websites are delivered within three to five weeks from kickoff, depending on content availability.

**Do I need SEO web design or just SEO?**
If you're building a new website, SEO web design is the most efficient approach. If you already have a site and want to improve its rankings, our [local SEO service](/services/local-seo-google-ranking/) may be the better fit.
